flowchart TD
  START[Next.js mutation request] --> AUTH[Validate actor + tenant + policy]
  AUTH --> DB[Commit Work Unit and outbox]
  DB --> TEMP[Temporal schedules Activity]
  TEMP --> CTX[Authorized context compiler]
  CTX --> AG[Bounded TS agent runtime]
  AG --> ROUTE[Model routing after egress policy]
  ROUTE --> TOOL[Typed tool proposal]
  TOOL --> CHECK{Authorized and within budget?}
  CHECK -->|No| DENY[Fail closed / audit]
  CHECK -->|Yes| APPROVAL{Sensitive action?}
  APPROVAL -->|Yes| HUMAN[Human approves exact payload]
  HUMAN --> EFFECT[Idempotent/reconciled tool effect]
  APPROVAL -->|No| EFFECT
  EFFECT --> VERIFY[Verify receipt and business outcome]
  VERIFY --> FINISH[Commit status, evidence, cost]
